      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `invoke_platform_model.py` that invokes a provider-managed model, I need to choose a concrete external provider and use its specific integration code. I will use Amazon Bedrock for this task, as it is a well-known managed service for machine learning models. I will import the necessary SDK and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
